== Part 2. Bytes: tree versus position table ==
cell = 24 B (f32) or 48 B (f64); body = 12/24 B; state row = 28/48 B
bucket 1: 0.72 internal cells per point (measured in part 1)
  |V|=1e+06: cells 7.20e+05; cells+bodies f32 27.9 MiB, f64 55.8 MiB; cells only f32 16.5 MiB; state table f32 26.7 MiB, f64 45.8 MiB
